		<name>Stormreader</name>
		<summary>EPUB reader that syncs progress and notes over WebDAV</summary>
		<desc>A quiet, fast EPUB reader.

* Tap the edges to turn pages, the middle for the menu.
* Drag the left edge for brightness, down past the screen's minimum.
* Notes at any position.
* Progress and notes sync through a WebDAV folder you own, one plain JSON file per book. Each device keeps its own position, and the app offers to jump to whichever device is furthest ahead.</desc>
